node_modules/
# Build output stays out of the repository — EXCEPT the two host-adapter
# artifacts, which no build step produces: they are generated from the shared
# host-adaptation layer and must ship with the package (see README, "Host
# compatibility"). The directory is opened up with `lib/*` rather than `lib/`
# because of a Git rule: a negated pattern cannot re-include a file whose
# PARENT DIRECTORY is excluded.
lib/*
!lib/host-adapter.js
!lib/host-adapter.d.ts
oss-sanitize-report.md
*.tgz
package-lock.json
